Subject: initialize optional escape parser state
Upstream-Status: Candidate (not submitted)
Replaces: new CVS source portability

Give the optional argument length and recursive escape coordinates explicit
initial values for MSVC's path-sensitive C4701 check. Valid special escapes
already set argl before diagnostic use; nested coordinates are read only after
roff_escape writes every output argument. Keep those assignments and behavior
unchanged rather than weakening the warning policy for the new translation unit.

--- a/roff_escape.c
+++ b/roff_escape.c
@@ -99,6 +99,7 @@
 	 */
 
 	iarg = iendarg = iend = inam + 1;
+	argl = 0;
 	maxl = INT_MAX;
 	term = '\0';
 	err = MANDOCERR_OK;
@@ -277,6 +278,7 @@
 	/* Decide how to end the argument. */
 
 	escterm = 0;
+	sesc = snam = sarg = sendarg = send = 0;
 	stype = ESCAPE_EXPAND;
 	if ((term == '\b' || (term == '\0' && maxl == INT_MAX)) &&
 	    buf[iarg] == buf[iesc]) {
